{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And now, go to [the place] of which I spoke to you.</b> To the place of the Canaanite (above, Exodus 3:8). This is in the manner of anger, for on your account I have borne their sin, and you — who loved them — thus lead them." "<b>And on the day.</b> The beginning of every year is the day of visitation."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "Resolved למעלה ג ח to Exodus 3:8 based on the cross-reference to the place of the Canaanite."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:57.610506509Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}